{
  "family_id": "F02_SETUP",
  "sprint": "P0.JURNL.F02-CURTAIN-CLEARANCE + GLOBAL-INTERACTIVE-TEXT-CONTAINMENT",
  "supersedes": "Single-rail map of P0.JURNL.F02-OPUS-FINAL-…-AUDIT1. The ARRIVAL edge was taken at the panel band; the sheer leans left toward the top, so headline and helper reached its fringe (clearance −1 to −2 px on a phone, 10 px on tablet).",
  "method": "Plate edges traced by hand on fraction-gridded crops (scripts/jurnl/f02-plate-edges.mjs). Two rails per plate, mapped through object-fit: cover + object-position with container units (jurnl-setup.css). Clearances measured live per text line and per paper card at its own height (scripts/jurnl/f02-final-audit-qa.mjs).",
  "formula": "edge_x(f) = px*100cqw + (f - px)*max(100cqw, 56.25cqh); head_rail = clamp(120px, edge_x(head_f) - head_gap - left, max); body_rail = clamp(160px, edge_x(body_f) - body_gap - left, max)",
  "required_clearance_px": {
